            "state": "translated",
            "value": "La sesión guardada ya no funciona. Hasta que vuelvas a iniciar sesión, el coach responde sin ChatGPT."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This ChatGPT account can't share its plan with apps. Add an API key in Settings → Coach to keep using the language model.": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
