    },
    "Connect your coach": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Conecta tu coach"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Cadencia's coach is an AI that reads your recovery, load, power and plan every day and decides your session. Sign in with ChatGPT to use your plan, or add an OpenAI API key.": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "El coach de Cadencia es una IA que lee cada día tu recuperación, carga, potencia y plan y decide tu sesión. Inicia sesión con ChatGPT para usar tu plan o añade una API key de OpenAI."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Set up the coach": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Configurar el coach"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Asking the coach…": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Preguntando al coach…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Decided %@ from your recovery, load, power and plan. Every number was range-checked before it reached the trainer.": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Decidido a las %@ a partir de tu recuperación, carga, potencia y plan. Cada número se comprobó dentro de rango antes de llegar al rodillo."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You've reached the usage limit of your ChatGPT plan for now. Manage it in Settings → Coach, or wait for it to reset.": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Has alcanzado por ahora el límite de uso de tu plan de ChatGPT. Gestiónalo en Ajustes → Coach o espera a que se reinicie."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your ChatGPT account can't share its plan with apps. Use an API key in Settings → Coach.": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tu cuenta de ChatGPT no puede compartir su plan con apps. Usa una API key en Ajustes → Coach."
          }
